[{"id":"smq-year1-1.07-q1","number":1,"question":"<p>Solve the following sets of simultaneous equations:</p><ol class=\"parts\" start=\"1\"><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"2x+3y=5\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"7x-y=6\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"6x=5-2y\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x-2y=2\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\frac{x-9}3+y=0\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"2(x+y)=2\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"3x-y=4\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\frac y2+\\frac x4=5\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li></ol>","steps":["<h3 class=\"part-label\">a)</h3><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x=1,y=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">b)</h3><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x=1,y=-\\frac12\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">c)</h3><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x-9+3y=0\\Rightarrow x+3y=9\" data-display=\"false\"></span>  <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"2x+2y=2\" data-display=\"false\"></span>  <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x=-3,y=4\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">d)</h3><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\frac y2+\\frac x4=5\\Rightarrow2y+x=20\" data-display=\"false\"></span>  <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x=4,y=8\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>"]},{"id":"smq-year1-1.07-q2","number":2,"question":"<p>It is given that <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y-kx=10\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=2x-10\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, where <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"k\" data-display=\"false\"></span> is an unknown constant, intersect when <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=15\" data-display=\"false\"></span>. Find</p><ol class=\"parts\" start=\"1\"><li><p>the <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x\" data-display=\"false\"></span>-coordinate of the point of intersection,</p></li><li><p>the value of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"k\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li></ol>","steps":["<h3 class=\"part-label\">a)</h3><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"15=2x-10\\Rightarrow x=\\frac{25}2\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">b)</h3><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"15-\\frac{25}2k=10\\Rightarrow k=\\frac25\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>"]},{"id":"smq-year1-1.07-q3","number":3,"question":"<p>Two lines are given to be <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y+ax=5\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\frac yb+\\frac{11x}{80}=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span> where <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"a\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"b\" data-display=\"false\"></span> are unknown constants. The two lines never intersect, and one line passes through the <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y\" data-display=\"false\"></span>-axis at <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=8\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p><ol class=\"parts\" start=\"1\"><li><p>the value of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"b\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p>the value of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"a\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li></ol>","steps":["<h3 class=\"part-label\">a)</h3><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\frac yb+\\frac{11x}{80}=1\\Rightarrow\\frac yb=-\\frac{11}{80}x+1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>  <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\Rightarrow y=b(-\\frac{11}{80}x+1)\" data-display=\"false\"></span>  <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\Rightarrow y=-\\frac{11}{80}bx+b\" data-display=\"false\"></span>  <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\therefore b=8\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">b)</h3><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=-\\frac{11}{10}x+8\" data-display=\"false\"></span>  Never intersect <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\Rightarrow\" data-display=\"false\"></span> same gradient  <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"a=\\frac{11}{10}\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>"]},{"id":"smq-year1-1.07-q4","number":4,"question":"<p>The diagram below shows two lines, which intersect at the point <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"(12,5)\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p><figure class=\"diagram\"><img src=\"assets/smq-1.07/questions/assets/diagrams/q4.png\" alt=\"Original mathematical diagram\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><p>Given one line has gradient <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"-\\frac14\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and the other line intersects the <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y\" data-display=\"false\"></span>-axis at <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, find the equations of both lines in the form <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"ay+bx=c\" data-display=\"false\"></span> where <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"a\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"b\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"c\" data-display=\"false\"></span> are integers.</p>","steps":["<p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"5=12\\times-\\frac14+c\\Rightarrow c=8\" data-display=\"false\"></span>  <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=-\\frac14x+8\" data-display=\"false\"></span>  <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"5=12m+1\\Rightarrow m=\\frac13\" data-display=\"false\"></span>  <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=\\frac13x+1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>  <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\therefore4y+x=32\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"3y-x=3\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>"]},{"id":"smq-year1-1.07-q5","number":5,"question":"<p>Solve the following sets of simultaneous equations:</p><ol class=\"parts\" start=\"1\"><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=2x+4\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=x^2+1\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=3x-2\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=x^2-4x-10\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=\\frac12x\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=x^2+2xy\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li></ol>","steps":["<h3 class=\"part-label\">a)</h3><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"2x+4=x^2+1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>  <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\Rightarrow x^2-2x-3=0\\Rightarrow(x-3)(x+1)=0\" data-display=\"false\"></span>  <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x=3,x=-1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>  <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"(3,10),(-1,2)\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">b)</h3><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"3x-2=x^2-4x-10\" data-display=\"false\"></span>  <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\Rightarrow x^2-7x-8=0\\Rightarrow(x-8)(x+1)=0\" data-display=\"false\"></span>  <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x=-1,x=8\" data-display=\"false\"></span>  <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"(-1,-5),(8,22)\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">c)</h3><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\frac12x=x^2+2x(\\frac12x)\" data-display=\"false\"></span>  <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\Rightarrow0=2x^2-\\frac12x\\Rightarrow0=4x^2-x=x(4x-1)\" data-display=\"false\"></span>  <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x=0,x=\\frac14\" data-display=\"false\"></span>  <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"(0,0),(\\frac14,\\frac18)\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>"]},{"id":"smq-year1-1.07-q6","number":6,"question":"<p>Two equations are given by <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"3y-x+10=0\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x^2+y^2=10\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p><ol class=\"parts\" start=\"1\"><li><p>Show that the two equations may be satisfied by <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x^2-2x+1=0\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p></li><li><p>Hence solve the simultaneous equations <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"3y-x+10=0\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x^2+y^2=10\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p></li></ol>","steps":["<h3 class=\"part-label\">a)</h3><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"3y=x-10\\Rightarrow y=\\frac13x-\\frac{10}3\" data-display=\"false\"></span>  <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\Rightarrow x^2+(\\frac13x-\\frac{10}3)^2=10\" data-display=\"false\"></span>  <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\Rightarrow x^2+\\frac19x^2-\\frac{20}9x+\\frac{100}9=10\" data-display=\"false\"></span>  <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\Rightarrow\\frac{10}9x^2-\\frac{20}9x+\\frac{100}9=10\\Rightarrow x^2-2x+10=9\" data-display=\"false\"></span>  <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\Rightarrow x^2-2x+1=0\" data-display=\"false\"></span> as req.</p>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">b)</h3><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x^2-2x+1=0\\Rightarrow(x-1)^2=0\" data-display=\"false\"></span>  <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>  <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=\\frac13\\times1-\\frac{10}3=-3\" data-display=\"false\"></span>  <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"(1,-3)\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>"]},{"id":"smq-year1-1.07-q7","number":7,"question":"<p>Solve the following sets of simultaneous equations:</p><ol class=\"parts\" start=\"1\"><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y+3x=15\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y^2=9(x-3)\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y-x=4\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x^2+y=10\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y-2x=12\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x^2+2xy=5\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li></ol>","steps":["<h3 class=\"part-label\">a)</h3><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=15-3x\\Rightarrow(15-3x)^2=9x-27\" data-display=\"false\"></span>  <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\Rightarrow9x^2-90x+225=9x-27\" data-display=\"false\"></span>  <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\Rightarrow9x^2-90x+225=9x-27\" data-display=\"false\"></span>  <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\Rightarrow9x^2-99x+252=0\" data-display=\"false\"></span>  <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\Rightarrow x=4,x=7\" data-display=\"false\"></span>  when <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x=4,y=15-12=3\" data-display=\"false\"></span>  when <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x=7,y=15-21=-6\" data-display=\"false\"></span>  <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"(4,3),(7,-6)\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">b)</h3><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=4+x\\Rightarrow x^2+(4+x)=10\" data-display=\"false\"></span>  <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\Rightarrow x^2+x-6=0\\Rightarrow(x+3)(x-2)=0\" data-display=\"false\"></span>  <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x=-3,x=2\" data-display=\"false\"></span>  When <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x=-3,y=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>  When <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x=2,y=6\" data-display=\"false\"></span>  <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"(-3,1),(2,6)\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">c)</h3><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=2x+12\\Rightarrow x^2+2x(2x+12)=5\" data-display=\"false\"></span>  <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\Rightarrow x^2+4x^2+24x-5=0\\Rightarrow5x^2+24x-5=0\" data-display=\"false\"></span>  <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\Rightarrow(5x-1)(x+5)=0\" data-display=\"false\"></span>  <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x=\\frac15,x=-5\" data-display=\"false\"></span>  When <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x=\\frac15,y=2\\times\\frac15+12=\\frac{62}5\" data-display=\"false\"></span>  When <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x=-5,y=2\\times-5+12=2\" data-display=\"false\"></span>  <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"(\\frac15,\\frac{62}5),(-5,2)\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>"]},{"id":"smq-year1-1.07-q8","number":8,"question":"<p>Solve the following sets of simultaneous equations:</p><ol class=\"parts\" start=\"1\"><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y+x=4\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x^2+y^2=16\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y+4x=6\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x^2+2x+y^2-3y=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"2y+x=8\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x^2+y^2-xy=12\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x=2y+1\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y^2+8=3xy\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li></ol>","steps":["<h3 class=\"part-label\">a)</h3><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=4-x\\Rightarrow x^2+(4-x)^2=16\" data-display=\"false\"></span>  <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x^2+16-8x+x^2=16\" data-display=\"false\"></span>  <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\Rightarrow2x^2-8x=0\\Rightarrow2x(x-4)=0\" data-display=\"false\"></span>  <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\Rightarrow x=0,x=4\" data-display=\"false\"></span>  When <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x=0,y=4\" data-display=\"false\"></span>  When <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x=4,y=0\" data-display=\"false\"></span>  <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"(0,4),(4,0)\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">b)</h3><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=6-4x\\Rightarrow x^2+2x+(6-4x)^2-3(6-4x)=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>  <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\Rightarrow x^2+2x+36-48x+16x^2-18+12x=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>  <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\Rightarrow17x^2-34x+17=0\\Rightarrow x=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>  When <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x=1,y=6-4=2\" data-display=\"false\"></span>  <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"(1,2)\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">c)</h3><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x=8-2y\\Rightarrow(8-2y)^2+y^2-(8-2y)y=12\" data-display=\"false\"></span>  <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\Rightarrow64-32y+4y^2+y^2-8y+2y^2=12\" data-display=\"false\"></span>  <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\Rightarrow7y^2-40y+52=0\" data-display=\"false\"></span>  <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=2,y=\\frac{26}7\" data-display=\"false\"></span>  When <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=2,x=8-4=4\" data-display=\"false\"></span>  When <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=\\frac{26}7,x=8-\\frac{52}7=\\frac47\" data-display=\"false\"></span>  <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"(4,2),(\\frac47,\\frac{26}7)\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">d)</h3><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y^2+8=3(2y+1)y\\Rightarrow y^2+8=6y^2+3y\" data-display=\"false\"></span>  <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\Rightarrow5y^2+3y-8=0\" data-display=\"false\"></span>  <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=1,y=-\\frac85\" data-display=\"false\"></span>  When <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=1,x=2\\times1+1=3\" data-display=\"false\"></span>  When <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=-\\frac85,x=2\\times-\\frac85+1=-\\frac{11}5\" data-display=\"false\"></span>  <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"(3,1),(-\\frac{11}5,-\\frac85)\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>"]},{"id":"smq-year1-1.07-q9","number":9,"question":"<p>Two equations are given by <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x^2+2x+y^2=24\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"2y=x-12\" data-display=\"false\"></span>. Show that there are no solutions when solving simultaneously.</p>","steps":["<p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x=2y+12\\Rightarrow(2y+12)^2+2(2y+12)+y^2=24\" data-display=\"false\"></span>  <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\Rightarrow4y^2+48y+144+4y+24+y^2=24\" data-display=\"false\"></span>  <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\Rightarrow5y^2+52y+144=0\" data-display=\"false\"></span>  <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=\\frac{-52\\pm\\sqrt{2704-2880}}{10}\" data-display=\"false\"></span> which has no real solutions.</p>"]},{"id":"smq-year1-1.07-q10","number":10,"question":"<p>The curve <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=px^2-qx+1\" data-display=\"false\"></span> where <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"p\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"q\" data-display=\"false\"></span> are positive constants, passes through the points <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"(5,36)\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"(-2,15)\" data-display=\"false\"></span>. Find the values of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"p\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"q\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","steps":["<p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"(5,36)\" data-display=\"false\"></span> gives <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"36=25p-5q+1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>  <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"(-2,15)\" data-display=\"false\"></span> gives <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"15=4p+2q+1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>  <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"35=25p-5q\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"14=4p+2q\" data-display=\"false\"></span>  <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"p=2,q=3\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>"]},{"id":"smq-year1-1.07-q11","number":11,"question":"<p>The curve <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=px^3-5x^2+x+q\" data-display=\"false\"></span> where <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"p\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"q\" data-display=\"false\"></span> are positive constants, passes through the points <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"(1,6)\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"(-\\frac12,\\frac{21}4)\" data-display=\"false\"></span>. Find the values of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"p\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"q\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","steps":["<p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"(1,6)\" data-display=\"false\"></span> gives <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"6=p-5+1+q\" data-display=\"false\"></span>  <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"(-\\frac12,\\frac{21}4)\" data-display=\"false\"></span> gives <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\frac{21}4=-\\frac18p-5\\times\\frac14-\\frac12+q\" data-display=\"false\"></span>  <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"10=p+q\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"7=-\\frac18p+q\" data-display=\"false\"></span>  <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"p=\\frac83,q=\\frac{22}3\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>"]},{"id":"smq-year1-1.07-q12","number":12,"question":"<p>Find the two positive real numbers with a product of 20 and a difference of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\frac83\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","steps":["<p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"xy=20\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x-y=\\frac83\" data-display=\"false\"></span>  <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\Rightarrow x=y+\\frac83\\Rightarrow(y+\\frac83)y=20\\Rightarrow y^2+\\frac83y-20=0\" data-display=\"false\"></span>  <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=\\frac{10}3,y=-6\" data-display=\"false\"></span>  When <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=\\frac{10}3,x=6\" data-display=\"false\"></span> (must be positive)  So <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\frac{10}3\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and 6</p>"]},{"id":"smq-year1-1.07-q13","number":13,"question":"<p>Solve the simultaneous equations <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"2^{x-1}=4^{2y}\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"9^{x-2}=3^{y+1}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","steps":["<p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"2^{x-1}=(2^2)^{2y}\\Rightarrow2^{x-1}=2^{4y}\\Rightarrow x-1=4y\" data-display=\"false\"></span>  <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"9^{x-2}=3^{y+1}\\Rightarrow(3^2)^{x-2}=3^{y+1}\\Rightarrow3^{2x-4}=3^{y+1}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>  <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\Rightarrow2x-4=y+1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>  So <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x-4y=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"2x-y=5\" data-display=\"false\"></span>  <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x=\\frac{19}7,y=\\frac37\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>"]},{"id":"smq-year1-1.07-q14","number":14,"question":"<p>Solve the simultaneous equations <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"5^{2x-3}=25^{y-1}\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"16^{x-1}=2^{3y}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","steps":["<p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"5^{2x-3}=(5^2)^{y-1}\\Rightarrow2x+3=2y-2\" data-display=\"false\"></span>  <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"(2^4)^{x-1}=2^{3y}\\Rightarrow4x-4=3y\" data-display=\"false\"></span>  So <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"2x-2y=-5\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"4x-3y=4\" data-display=\"false\"></span>  <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x=\\frac52,y=2\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>"]}]